    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pub_json",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 376,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 348,
      "text": "warrant: { proof, publicSignals[8] }\n\n0  merkleRoot           == MandateRegistry.currentRoot\n1  contextHash          scopes the nullifier\n2  nullifier            Poseidon(humanTag, context)\n3  effectiveScope       last enabled hop bits\n4  effectiveBudgetCap   ceiling, not a coin\n5  minExpiry            shop's now\n6  tier                 0 on this host\n7  requestHash          this exact challenge\n\nnot your name\nnot your address\nnot the hops",
      "originalText": "warrant: { proof, publicSignals[8] }\n\n0  merkleRoot           == MandateRegistry.currentRoot\n1  contextHash          scopes the nullifier\n2  nullifier            Poseidon(humanTag, context)\n3  effectiveScope       last enabled hop bits\n4  effectiveBudgetCap   ceiling, not a coin\n5  minExpiry            shop's now\n6  tier                 0 on this host\n7  requestHash          this exact challenge\n\nnot your name\nnot your address\nnot the hops",
